function MRpulse(q,i){if(q.reduced)return 0;let p=0;for(const e of q.hits)if(e.target===i){const age=q.t-e.time;if(age>=0&&age<1.2)p+=Math.exp(-age*4.5)}return MRclamp(p)}
function MRphase(t,D=12,reduced=false){D=Math.max(MR_MIN,D);const settle=D-2.5,v=MRclamp((t-settle)/.8),clock=reduced?0:t-.85*(.8*(v**3-v**4/2)+Math.max(0,t-settle-.8));return {D,t,clock,alpha:t>=D?0:(.3+.7*MRease(t/.4))*(1-MRease((t-D+1.05)/1.05)),grow:reduced?1:.9+.1*MRout(t/.7)};}


const MRnode=(x,y,r=.15,extra={})=>({x,y,r,...extra});
const MRrow=(n,y=.3,r=.13)=>Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>MRnode((i/(n-1)-.5)*1.9,typeof y==='function'?y(i):y,r));
const MRring=(n,rx=.85,ry=.55,cy=.1,offset=-Math.PI/2)=>Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>{const a=offset+i/n*MR_TAU;return MRnode(Math.cos(a)*rx,cy+Math.sin(a)*ry,.12,{a})});
function MRpond(c,q){const p=q.p;for(let k=0;k<5;k++){const r=.7+k*.08;MRellipse(c,0,.32,r,r*.46,p[k%p.length],.04+k*.007);MRellipse(c,0,.32,r,r*.46,p[k%p.length],.18,true,.0025)}for(let i=0;i<q.nodes.length;i++){const n=q.nodes[i],col=p[i%p.length];MRglow(c,n.x,n.y,n.r*1.5,col,.18);MRmaterial(c,()=>{c.beginPath();c.ellipse(n.x,n.y,n.r,n.r*.42,0,0,MR_TAU)},col,q,.5,[n.x-n.r,n.y-n.r*.42,n.x+n.r,n.y+n.r*.42]);MRline(c,MRcurve([n.x-n.r*.7,n.y],[n.x-n.r*.3,n.y-n.r*.28],[n.x+n.r*.2,n.y-n.r*.26],[n.x+n.r*.55,n.y-n.r*.1]),MRmix(col,'#ffffff',.65),.004,.7);MRellipse(c,n.x,n.y,n.r,n.r*.42,MRmix(col,'#ffffff',.5),.55,true,.004);MRpearl(c,n.x,n.y,.023,col,.8);for(let k=0;k<4;k++){const a=k/4*MR_TAU+q.clock*.12;MRpearl(c,n.x+Math.cos(a)*n.r*.82,n.y+Math.sin(a)*n.r*.32,.006,col,.8)}}}
function MRharpFrame(){return MRcurve([-1,.65],[-1.15,-.82],[.5,-1.12],[1,.68],90)}
